WEBVTT

1
00:00:09.334 --> 00:00:18.738
Hello! Who are you?

2
00:00:18.739 --> 00:00:22.776
I'm a great horned owl.

3
00:00:22.777 --> 00:00:26.047
We are raptors.

4
00:00:26.048 --> 00:00:30.468
Raptors are birds that hunt.

5
00:00:30.469 --> 00:00:33.153
Where do you live?

6
00:00:33.154 --> 00:00:38.366
Great horned owls live in many places.

7
00:00:38.367 --> 00:00:44.671
We like forests, tundra, and even cities.

8
00:00:44.672 --> 00:00:48.685
We often make nests in tree holes.

9
00:00:48.686 --> 00:00:51.092
How do you hunt?

10
00:00:51.093 --> 00:00:56.955
We can fly without making a sound.

11
00:00:56.956 --> 00:01:01.993
Our eyes help us see in the dark.

12
00:01:01.994 --> 00:01:07.226
I see your sharp claws!

13
00:01:07.227 --> 00:01:12.530
We use our sharp claws to kill prey.

14
00:01:12.531 --> 00:01:18.297
Our claws help us carry food too.

15
00:01:18.298 --> 00:01:22.224
What do you eat?

16
00:01:22.225 --> 00:01:29.236
We eat mice, raccoons, and sometimes skunks.

17
00:01:29.237 --> 00:01:33.518
We swallow our prey whole.

18
00:01:33.519 --> 00:01:38.108
Then we spit up the bones and fur.

19
00:01:38.109 --> 00:01:42.018
Are those horns on your head?

20
00:01:42.019 --> 00:01:47.417
No, they are just tall feathers.

21
00:01:47.418 --> 00:01:51.845
But these feathers look like horns!

22
00:01:51.846 --> 00:01:55.102
Do you have any enemies?

23
00:01:55.103 --> 00:02:01.671
Sometimes crows gather around us.

24
00:02:01.672 --> 00:02:06.704
They caw loudly and chase us.

25
00:02:06.705 --> 00:02:11.442
It's getting dark—time to hunt!

26
00:02:11.443 --> 00:02:15.103
Hoo-hoo-hoo!

27
00:02:15.104 --> 00:02:23.350
Good-bye, Great Horned Owl!
